+ ### 1.1 Quota check
+ A vocal `mmx music generate` call is roughly **1 Plus unit** on Plus;
+ `mmx music cover` is ~1 (one-step) or ~2 (two-step). The 5-hour pool
+ (~4,500 M2.7-equivalent calls) is the real ceiling, not RPM.
